# Build context of the API image. The Maven build needs the wrapper, the POM and src/; everything
# else is dead weight, and the heavy or sensitive directories (the site with its node_modules and
# dist, the captured raw data, the git metadata, the other checkouts under .worktrees) stay out.

.git
.gitattributes
.github
.agents
.atl
.worktrees
target
**/target
web
capture
odd
docs
deploy
compose.yaml
skills-lock.json
*.md

# Database dumps kept inside the checkout by overriding BACKUP_DIR (F4) must never reach the build context.
backups
**/backups
